{"id":200,"date":"2025-02-20T10:00:20","date_gmt":"2025-02-20T10:00:20","guid":{"rendered":"http:\/\/eaglebayshipping.com\/?page_id=200"},"modified":"2026-03-17T14:09:59","modified_gmt":"2026-03-17T14:09:59","slug":"sustainability","status":"publish","type":"page","link":"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/sustainability\/","title":{"rendered":"Sustainability"},"content":{"rendered":"<div id=\"pl-200\"  class=\"panel-layout\" ><div id=\"pg-200-0\"  class=\"panel-grid panel-has-style\"  style=\"margin-bottom: 30px\" ><div class=\"so-rounded panel-row-style panel-row-style-for-200-0\" ><div id=\"pgc-200-0-0\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-200-0-0-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-editor panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"0\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-editor so-widget-sow-editor-base\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"siteorigin-widget-tinymce textwidget\">\n\t<h2><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; font-size: 14pt;\">Our sustainable focus seeing us strive to greatness<\/span><\/h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Gosford Storage and Logistics Ltd. leading vision of leading excellence at the oil and gas energy sector, we are fully dedicated to <\/span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">strive to be industry shaper by implementing solutions that add value and drive sustainability. We are committed to setting <\/span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">new standards within the oil and gas industry, focusing on innovative practices that not only enhance operational efficiency <\/span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">but also prioritize environmental stewardship. By embracing cutting-edge technologies and sustainable methodologies, we <\/span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">aim to create long-term benefits for our stakeholders while contributing to the well-being of our planet.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size: 13px;\"><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">Our sustainability strategy outlines our aspirations and priorities concerning our efforts in sustainability. This comprehensive <\/span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">strategy is a pivotal element in our journey towards enhancing our sustainability maturity, guiding our actions and decisions <\/span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">to ensure they align with our commitment to sustainability. It provides a framework for integrating sustainable practices <\/span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">across all facets of our organization, influencing our operations, and engaging our stakeholders in meaningful ways. By <\/span><span style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\">adhering to this strategy, we aim to foster a culture of sustainability that permeates every level of our company.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<div class=\"host-lopnbnfpjmgpbppclhclehhgafnifija\" style=\"position: relative; z-index: 2147483647;\"><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div><\/div><div id=\"pgc-200-0-1\"  class=\"panel-grid-cell\" ><div id=\"panel-200-0-1-0\" class=\"so-panel widget widget_sow-image panel-first-child panel-last-child\" data-index=\"1\" ><div\n\t\t\t\n\t\t\tclass=\"so-widget-sow-image so-widget-sow-image-default-8b5b6f678277-200\"\n\t\t\t\n\t\t>\n<div class=\"sow-image-container\">\n\t\t<img \n\tsrc=\"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/eggle-3.jpg?wsr\" width=\"1920\" height=\"1280\" srcset=\"https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/eggle-3.jpg 1920w, https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/eggle-3-300x200.jpg 300w, https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/eggle-3-1024x683.jpg 1024w, https:\/\/dongzhanshipping.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2025\/02\/eggle-3-768x512.jp